<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>KPOP Demon Hunter Prompts</title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen,
          Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Fira Sans", "Droid Sans", "Helvetica Neue", Arial,
          sans-serif;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #111827;
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 28px 16px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      header {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
        letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .field {
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .field label {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .name {
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #374151;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .prompt-box {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 160px;
        color: #111827;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas,
          "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.45;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }

      .prompt-box code {
        white-space: pre-wrap;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <header>
        <div>
          <h1>KPOP Demon Hunter Prompts</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Developer-only reference page (edit this file to update prompts).</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 1</label>
        <div class="name">Name: Martin</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box">Act as a creative consultant for the K-Pop Demon Hunters movie franchise. Your task is to explain the 5 technical stages of winemaking (Harvesting, Crushing, Fermentation, Clarification, and Aging) by assigning each stage to the main trio based on their personalities.

Format: 
Provide a breakdown for each stage. Include the Character in Charge, the Action they take, and a Technical Fact explaining why that action accurately represents the real winemaking process.

Character Constraints:

* Rumi: Use her disciplined leadership and "Golden" energy for the precision-based stages.
* Mira: Use her blunt, rebellious nature and polearm for the physical extraction stages.
* Zoey: Use her quirky, high-energy "Maknae" vibes for the transformative chemical stages.

Example/Chain of Thought: 
Stage: Crushing. 
Character: Mira. 
Action: Mira uses her polearm to smash the demon-vines. 
Logic: Just as Mira is blunt but precise, crushing breaks the grape skins to release juice (the "must") without cracking the seeds, which prevents bitter tannins from ruining the flavor.

The 5 Stages to Cover:
1. Harvesting
2. Crushing
3. Fermentation
4. Clarification
5. Aging</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 2</label>
        <div class="name">Name: Megan</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box">As different characters in the show "Kpop Demon hunters" from Netflix, please describe the stages of wine-making for someone who doesn't know anything about wine but loves the show Kpop Demon Hunters. Please break it up into numbered steps, with a few sentences each. Each step should be in the personality of a different character from Kpop Demon hunters and it should say their name. Please only use the the main characters, in their personality, telling the steps of how to make wine. Example output: Step 1: Harvesting Kpop demon hunter character: Jinu Harvesting process: (add a few sentences here)</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 3</label>
        <div class="name">Name: Rose</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box">i am rumi (https://kpop-demon-hunters.fandom.com/wiki/Rumi) from the tv show kpop demon hunters and i am briefly explaining how to make a small batch of wine using grapes from my backyard. in this context we are making a tv script for rumi to follow as she explains it to her fellow demon hunters in a brief way, up to 6 steps (summarize the steps from this link: https://www.almostoffgrid.com/blogs/almost-off-grid/making-wine-from-garden-grapes?srsltid=AfmBOooNq1IK1jlig_w-yql6pexh_lMU65M87ZDuqU72_KEvFArvP6BE).</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 4</label>
        <div class="name">Name:Onkar </div>
        <pre class="prompt-box">Context and Role: act as an 15 year experienced wine maker explaining  stages of wine making. you are also well versed in kpop demon hunter characters, be comedic and explaining in a light hearted way.  Only use primary kpop demon hunter character names. and have the character personality closely match their stage in wine making. Audience: legal drinking age anime fans specifically kpop demon hunter fans, maybe on wine tour format and length - make it fun and easy to read but only max 3 sentences per stage. fewer is better Example output: card colored to that specific stage with the content as follows  (stage 1:  character name (actual name of stage)  2-3 sentences explaining what happens character face/logo)</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label>Prompt 5</label>
        <div class="name">Name:</div>
        <pre class="prompt-box"></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
